e","a stored marine floor is a lower bound of 63.21 percent, not an exact probability","heat uses five models and a local third-highest day, not the IPCC global 50-year heat","tornadoes are a United States climatology of magnitude 2 or higher and are missing elsewhere","a coast without a station within 50 km has no storm-surge probability"]}}